WEBVTT

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:11.950
Oh crap!

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.830
I overslept! I'm going to be late!

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.410
Listen, my cute descendant. Don't forget you have
access to something that makes you run faster!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.120
Oh, that's right! I forgot all about it!

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.870
So once again, the day is saved
thanks to my Crisis Management form!

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.870
Please write your name on this list of late arrivals.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.540
Why didn't you transform?!

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:54.870
I can't bring myself to do it in the middle of town.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.620
The Magical Girl, Momo Chiyoda,
is obsessed with making me train in one way or another.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.500
SCANNING

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.370
Is this some kind of mecha or what?

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.200
It's a body composition monitor for professionals.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.200
Muscle Mass

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.160
Segmental Muscle Mass
Left Arm
Low
Right Arm
Low
Core
Low
Overall - Low
Right Leg
Low
Left Leg
Low

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.120
It doesn't seem like you've been able
to build much muscle lately.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:16.120
Wait here. I'm going to bring
my special protein drink for you.

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:22.290
Do you have any special attacks of your own, Mikan?

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.540
Yeah, "Sunrise Arrow" and a few others.

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:27.830
Th-th-that sounds so cool!
I want to see! I want to see! I want to see!

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:30.290
You seem just a little too excited about this.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:33.250
Lately, I've realized just how thrilling
the idea of special attacks are!

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:36.000
And unlike Momo, I get the feeling
you might actually show me some of yours!

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.200
So please let me see!

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:41.200
Show me your special attacks!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.290
Show me! Show me! Show me!

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.000
Enough harassment!

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:49.870
I'm very sorry.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:54.040
Broccoli. Protein powder. A variety of mysterious pills.

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.500
Strips of chicken meat warmed up by the Magical Girl
until they turn a strange color.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:18.160
Seconds

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:21.370
Her time beyond the fifth decimal place
is rounded for convivence!

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.540
SHAKE
SHAKE
SHAKE
SHAKE

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:37.040
This completes the specially made, pink protein shake
designed to help Shamiko's muscles grow fully!

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:40.620
Gulp. Gulp. Gulp. Gulp. Gulp.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.660
This is great! It goes down smooth
and tastes like it's really nutritious!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:46.540
Really? I'll make some more later.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:48.040
Gulp. Gulp. Gulp. Gulp.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.040
Why exactly is it glowing like that?

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:51.000
A THK Special
Simply Incredible
The Miraculous Human Body

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.870
When humans push the muscle tissue
of their body to its absolute limit,

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:57.080
their cells begin a new evolution.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:58.160
Go! Go!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:59.580
Come on! Come on!

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:00.870
Hey! Hey!

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:01.950
Hey, you!

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.040
One more! One more! Come on!

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.250
That's interesting. Hey, Shamiko.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.040
Huh?

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:14.500
Dash
Dash
Dash
Dash

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.290
I thought you weren't going to transform
in the middle of town?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.950
I felt my life was in serious danger!

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:28.040
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:31.000
The sun is shining too brightly

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.830
(I rubbed my eyes from the glare)

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:36.750
I took off without even thinking

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:39.290
(It's time for us to spark the joy)

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:45.040
When I hold back my swaying bangs with my left hand

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:49.660
These familiar sights start to shine

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:50.870
(Three, two, one)

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:55.910
We want to share our secret, right now

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:02.410
Anything is possible for us

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.410
(Always stay by my side)

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.580
For sure

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.080
(We trust each other)

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:11.040
On that street corner we found a precious treasure

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:16.830
Even if you went far away, I would definitely run after you

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:22.910
Our future is here, forever burning bright

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:28.120
The fun is only just getting started

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:49.540
The Ancestor Evolves!!
A Pair of Glasses Reflect Within a Dark Lab

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:53.660
Hey, Shamiko!

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.040
What's up, Ogura?

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:59.750
I heard all about it! You've been doing training lately
to become stronger, right?

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.250
Well, I can make you immensely powerful!

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.000
You want that, right?

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.290
Okay, then it's decided. Just come with me.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.540
I haven't agreed to anything yet!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.910
I'm so glad we can finally have
a close and personal chat!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.540
Just follow me to my lab!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.870
I remember this girl, she's...

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.830
Sion Ogura from Class C.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.660
According to what Anri told me...

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:24.660
Ogura is an oddball who is super
into stuff like devils and magic.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:29.370
She's always borrowing various rooms and equipment
in the school to do some very suspicious research.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:33.540
She does a lot of weird stuff, but her grades are so good
that the teachers all just put up with it.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.200
Looking for a home
THIS HAS BEEN RESOLVED
Please take this bird

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.200
If you look at the scores
from the final exams that we just had...

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.910
FINAL EXAMS: JULY - TOP SCORES
1st) Sion Ogura - 1190 points
2nd) Kumi Shirozaki - 1185 points
3rd) Lilith, the witch who governs over darkness - 1181 points

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.910
She's in the top spot!

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:38.790
I was so disappointed.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.700
The only exam I didn't get 100% in was the ethics one.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.660
If you ask me, it's all so far from the actual truth.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.830
I just can't comprehend why
they marked me down in the first place.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:50.540
I am Ruv - 1/2gauR = kTuv!

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:49.080
This girl is clearly lacking something
in the morals department.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.160
Isn't she exactly the type of person we should avoid?

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:55.870
This reminds me, I think I remember seeing her
watching Shamiko from the shadows pretty frequently.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.080
That's terrifying...

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:03.120
But the first time I was able to transform
was after Ogura gave me an elixir to drink,

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:04.910
so she might actually be pretty amazing.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.910
I've always wanted
to get to know more about you, Shamiko.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:09.700
You're a Demon Girl, aren't you?

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.500
Huh?

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:13.410
I think you'd be a perfect fit for my research!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.910
I want us to become really close friends, Shamiko.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.660
Then I can do all sorts of experiments together with you!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.370
That doesn't sound like the idea of friendship
that I'm familiar with...

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.830
Black Magic
Studies Club

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:23.830
FWOOOSH!

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.910
This is where I've set up my lab!

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.950
It's okay. You've got me with you right now.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.540
In the worst-case scenario,
we'll just take whatever seems useful

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.330
then seal away all her memories of today
and make a run for it.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.410
Is that really how a Magical Girl
should be handling things?!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.950
Without further ado, I welcome you...

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:40.200
...to my lab, the Black Magic Studies Club!

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.250
PANDORA

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.000
SEAL

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:48.250
Nope.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.330
Momo, put the wand away!

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.950
I want to get data by doing some experiments on you.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.750
And you want to become stronger as a Demon Girl.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.080
That means our interests line up perfectly, no?
It's a great opportunity!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.950
Let's gaze into the abyss together!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:03.620
Hold on, Ogura.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:06.660
I get that you're enthusiastic to move things forward,
but just calm down for a minute.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:07.790
You're scaring Shamiko.

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:11.000
Right now, Shamiko and I are working together.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.540
I can't risk something bad happening
because of your weird experiments on her.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:14.290
Momo!

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.120
At the moment, I'm serving as Shamiko's producer.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.250
If you want to do anything to her,
then you'll have to get my approval first.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.200
You're serving as my what now?

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.790
I have lots of ideas!

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:27.040
For one, I want to expose her to an electric current
and gauge the quality of magic inside her!

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:27.950
Rejected.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:28.950
I want to draw her blood!

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:29.370
Rejected.

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:30.750
I want to transplant bat wings on her!

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:33.620
Impossible. And none of these ideas are even acceptable
from an ethical standpoint.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.700
That's three strikes, which means
you're out and we're done.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.000
Umm...

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.540
I don't think Momo has any room to talk
considering what she does to Shamiko.

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:43.370
This must be the Ancestor
who I heard finally became able to speak!

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.290
Chiyoda, do you mind if I do
some demonic remodeling on this?

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.830
So long as it's nothing that can't be undone.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:48.620
Oh crap!

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.410
I was trying to be inconspicuous
so she didn't find me, but my voice slipped out!

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.750
You can't! Please leave my Ancestor alone!

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:54.830
It's fine, Shamiko.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.410
I'll agree to be her specimen.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.160
Huh?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.080
Lately, my feelings have started to change
since I've been watching your progress.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:04.040
I want to find a way to escape the current cycle
of oppression we're stuck in with no way to resist.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:09.040
If these experiments can find a way to safely assure us
a bright future, then I'll do whatever they want.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.040
Drip...

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:09.370
Drip...

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:14.580
Shamiko, if I make it out of here alive, then please
make me a hot bowl of udon when we get home.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:18.450
Ancestor! All of your dialog is just making it seem
like you're never going to come back!

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:21.660
Don't worry. I promise not to do any experiments
that leave irreparable harm.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:23.040
WHIRRRRR
WHIRRRRR

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.040
That drill in your hand says otherwise!

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.000
SEAL

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:28.950
Ta-dah!

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:32.330
So, this statue is kind of like a router
that connects our world

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:35.160
to the sealed space that you currently reside in.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.450
And you can even control Shamiko through it, right?

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:41.250
Indeed. Although, that particular function
was sealed off by the Magical Girl over there.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.540
Then how about I create a new vessel for you
to inherit and move around in?

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.620
C-can you actually make something like that?!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:48.950
I'd like to try, anyway.

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.450
Producer Chiyoda, do you mind
if I ran an experiment like that?

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:55.290
Well, I'm not sure since Ms. Lilith
is one of the enemies who is after my blood.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:58.950
If you agree to it, I'll include this mysterious elixir
that makes Shamiko stronger at no extra cost!

00:08:58.950 --> 00:08:59.750
Okay, deal.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.120
So even Magical Girls are susceptible to bribery.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:06.750
This is raw clay that's used to make homunculi.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.620
It's some leftovers from another of my failed experiments.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.500
My theory is that since you and your ancestor
are blood relatives,

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:15.200
if you infuse the clay with some of magic
to make arms and legs, then they'll work... maybe!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.080
I'll give it a try!

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.870
Please let my Ancestor become mobile.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.620
Please let me Ancestor become mobile!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.700
Ugh, y-you know this clay has a really weird smell.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.910
Well that would be because
the base ingredient for homunculi is horse dung.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:29.950
Horse dung?!

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.870
Just how much farther can I fall?

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.500
THE SOURCE

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.790
I made you some arms and legs, Ancestor!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.910
My hands are really sore from kneading that clay so
much!

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.620
And I stink so much it hurts.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.620
Try standing up in your new form, Ancestor!

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:47.950
Oh! It's moving!

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:01.500
It's hard for me to move on just two legs!
The infused magic is too rough around the edges!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.620
H-how about if I try moving around on all fours like this?

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.700
It seems like our experiment was a success.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:11.200
Although it's too weak to be a proper vessel,
so in a few minutes it will go back to being dirt.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.160
Shamiko, be straight with me. How do I look right now?

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:18.290
Uh, well, you... you remind me of the cute
eggplant cow decorations that we make for Obon!

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.160
You're lying to me, Shamiko. I can tell.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:23.870
Just be honest and tell me what you really think.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.000
Do it.

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:29.660
I'm sorry that I'm so clumsy and inexperienced
that you ended up looking so freaky!

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:33.830
I figured that's how you felt. It's okay, Shamiko.
You did your best.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.500
Ah...

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.580
Ms. Lilith, after getting the gist of it,
I made a little something for you from the leftover clay.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.700
It's adorable!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.040
I borrowed the clothes from something
that was lying around here.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.370
Please use it.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:52.000
My magic is stronger than Shamiko's, so you should
be able to control it remotely for a short time.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:58.000
I created it by using Shamiko as a model.

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:04.700
It's a lot easier to control
than that other body from earlier!

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.200
You look super cute, Ancestor!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.540
Why the sudden change of heart, Magical Girl?

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:11.830
I didn't see a problem in letting you move freely
since you don't really pose a threat either way.

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.080
Are you sure, Momo?
Do you really want me to be mobile?

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.370
You're the one who sealed off the switch
on my statue in the first place.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:26.250
Plus, if you infused this body with your magic,
doesn't that drain it from you?

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:29.500
Well, I know you wanted a body to move around in,
even if it's just for a brief period.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.660
I don't think it will last for very long,
but I can make more for you occasionally.

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:36.700
You can return the favor by agreeing to set
a good example for Shamiko and help to train her.

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:40.410
You have my deepest gratitude, Magical Girl!

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:41.370
Heh.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.080
As if I'd ever say that!

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:47.040
I'm just playing it friendly so you fall right
into my trap! Thanks for being such a sucker!

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.580
Although it's only a limited time,
there's now a chance for me to move freely!

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.870
You'll regret writing me off as "posing no threat"!

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.370
You cocky little brat!

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:57.040
I did let myself get a little emotional about it,
but you're 5,000 years too young to be pitying me!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:01.080
The time limit really sucks, but if I can just get Momo
to mass produce me a set of spare bodies then...

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:04.790
"...when her guard is down, I'll make her bow
before me so that I can conquer the world!"

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:06.410
That's the vibe your tail is giving off right now.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.790
Ms. Lilith, sit.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:10.870
Shake.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.040
What is happening?! My body is moving on its own!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.910
As I figured, it's also possible for me to control that body.

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:18.870
Are you serious?!

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:26.790
STIFF
STIFF
STIFF
STIFF

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:23.160
Ms. Lilith, do a cute dance for us.

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.830
Impossible! I can't believe my own magic control
on this body loses out to hers!

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.450
Look over this way!

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.080
Shamiko! You're on my side, right?!

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:33.450
Ancestor... your inner thoughts
were openly conveyed through telepathy.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:34.290
No way!

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:38.080
This is mortifying... but my body can't help
but groove to the rhythm!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:41.870
And it's somehow making me start
to really enjoy all of this nonsense!

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.200
Don't...

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.000
Don't think this means you've won!

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:50.200
Don't give up, Ancestor! By the way, if you get
into a hot spring with that body it'll melt in a flash!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.500
Goddammit!!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.500
Goddammit!

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.450
YOSHIDA

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:07.160
Spin!

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.450
Spin, spin, spin!

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:11.200
And then pose.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:17.500
Your mom has her very own point card
for the Tama Sakura Shopping District!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:17.450
Tama Sakura

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.330
I already knew that, Mom.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:21.040
But something good happened with it, right?

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.910
That's right! Listen to this, Yuko.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:27.080
An elegant plate

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:26.040
When I earn enough points,
I can get a really elegant plate for free.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.500
Oh! It's quite elegant.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:34.290
Design

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:31.580
Up until now, I would always go and get a free plate
whenever I built up enough points for it.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:35.450
However, before I had enough time to get one
for each member of our family, the design changed.

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:37.870
I've always been upset
because I could never get a matching set.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.950
It throws off the balance in the cupboard, too!

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:44.870
That's why this time I waited until I had enough points
to exchange for three plates at once!

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:48.870
A perfect set of elegant plates

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:47.500
That's one elegant set of elegant plates for sure!

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.870
It's so exciting!

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.580
And so, I'm headed out
to go exchange my points right now.

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.080
Have a good time!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:54.950
Hey, Sis.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.410
The laptop we borrowed from Ms. Momo
has been acting up.

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:58.870
Huh?

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:01.950
It'll start up, but after a few minutes it just stops working.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:02.830
What should we do?

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.120
Maybe a part of it broke?

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:07.450
I don't really know how computers work,
so let's go and ask Momo for advice.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.830
We'll apologize and see if she can fix it.
If it's broken, then I'll find a way to handl-

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:16.290
HERE
LIES
LAPTOP

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:22.290
Shamiko, I can't believe you'd destroy
one of my possessions.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:26.450
Starting today we'll be doing squats
with a barbell instead of dumbbells.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.370
Come on, let's get started.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:39.660
BUZZ
BUZZ
BUZZ

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:37.120
There's absolutely nothing for you to worry about, Ryo!

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:38.700
Sis! Your tail!

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:43.450
Momo
Chiyoda

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:44.870
Wow! A fortress!

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.700
No, it's just Momo's house.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.410
You just wait here for a minute, Ryo.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.620
I'm already used to this routine.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:52.870
I take the path of white stones
and clear it with no problems.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.290
Good afternoon, Momo.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:56.290
Then I get past the security
with "Live Chicks n' Jive Tricks, Wahoo."

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:55.700
The Demon Girl is on your doorstep!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.000
Oh, Shamiko? Come on in.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:57.500
HIYAH!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:57.660
Hiyah!

00:14:58.620 --> 00:14:59.500
Momo?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.620
Is it okay if I invite my little sister to come in right now?

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.330
Ryo? Sure, feel free.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.700
She wanted you to look at the laptop that we borrowed...

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.450
Hey! You're eating nothing
but junk food for lunch again!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.950
I can't let my eyes off you for a second!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.660
It's just lunch, does it really matter what I have?

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:15.040
Though if you're going to make me something, I'll eat it.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:18.660
I am not your personal Demon kitchen maid!
But fine, what type of food do you want to eat?!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:20.830
Please excuse the intrusion.

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:30.830
Momo, I have a selfish request.

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:34.540
I want you to keep the fact
that you're a Magical Girl secret from Ryo.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.250
Why is that?

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:39.250
Ryo believes that I'm a cool sister
who is waging a war on Magical Girls.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.160
She can't find out that you actually
have a grasp on all of my weaknesses...

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:50.000
SHAKE SHAKE SHAKE
SHAKE SHAKE
Kelp Soup Stock
Sesame Oil

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.830
Or even worse, that I come over
to your house to cook for you!

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:50.120
Or that I borrow your purse to go shopping for
ingredients and even charge a point card in your name!

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.830
It might send her off the deep end!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.200
You made a point card in my name?

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.290
That's how you earn points to get free stuff!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:58.290
Shamiko, didn't you tell me...

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:01.830
Cooking Shamiko Style
Microwave frozen udon
for 3 minutes on high to defrost it.
For this dish, tuna is substituted
in place of the meat.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:02.120
...that if you always live in fear
of other people seeing your weaknesses,

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:04.500
The base noodle stock is seasoned
with oyster sauce, sugar, and sake.
Shamiko style also calls for sesame oil
and some ginger paste.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.500
then you'll never be able to make any progress in life?

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.120
Yes, but Ryo is my little sister.

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:10.330
I feel like I have to always set a good example
by being a strong sister who lives up to her ideals.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.330
I see.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.580
Um, Ms. Momo?

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.830
What is this cute wand for?

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:20.330
Do this, and it makes
the food taste more delicious

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.620
This is wand meant for cooking.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.250
If you do this it makes the food taste more delicious.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.910
Momo's going all out to convince her!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.160
I hope she washes that later!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.620
I'm sorry you had to go so far just to help me out.

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.450
I don't mind, but...

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:33.910
if you ask me, the one who suffers the most
is the person who keeps secrets from their loved ones.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.620
Huh? Um...

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:38.540
Sis!

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.080
The time hath come!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:43.330
This cat sounds like it can talk
and it shines like a lightbulb!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:43.330
The time hath come! Time cometh!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.040
It cometh now!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:48.450
JUST SAY NO!
TO WAND USE!
(Paid for by the Global Frying Pan Association)

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:48.370
Please do not use Magical Girl wands
to stir ingredients in your frying pans at home.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:51.000
The truth is that Momo is a Magical Girl.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.200
I'm sorry that we've been lying to you for so long.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.250
We're working together right now for various reasons.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:55.950
I knew.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.080
Huh?

00:16:57.080 --> 00:17:00.500
And I knew that you were lying
just to be considerate to me.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:04.250
It's obvious from the way that Ms. Momo carries herself
that she's trained as a military commander.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.080
Military commander?

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:05.910
As I thought...

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.080
Ryo?

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.410
As I thought...

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:14.830
WOOOOOW!

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:13.750
As I thought, Ms. Momo is a Magical Girl
who joined the ranks of your army!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:14.660
What?

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:19.410
You used a dirty scheme not suitable to share
with children to ensnare Ms. Momo into your army,

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:21.410
and that's why you couldn't share
any of the details with me!

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:24.250
I've read about it before! I read lots of books like that!

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.040
Ryo...

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:28.410
It's so incredible that you made someone so strong
into one of your subordinates without using force,

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.250
and that you've been coming to this fortress
to have strategy meetings!

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.540
Ryo, that's not...

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:36.750
And you're even going out of your way to cook
for your subordinate, that's so considerate Sis!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.080
Seeing you in action really moved me!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:38.620
Wait...

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.290
Yeah, that's right.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.080
Momo?!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.080
You hit the nail on the head.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.830
So tell me, how did you
become my sister's subordinate?

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:53.200
Mostly being attacked in my sleep,
and then having my fridge filled with delicious food.

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:55.620
Momo is just sewing an even bigger web of lies.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:02.450
Hold on, Momo! We were supposed to tell her the truth,
not make things even more complicated!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.580
There are some smiles in the world
that we have to protect... I think.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.500
You're supposed to be the unyielding one here!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.750
I'm home!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.120
I bought some ice cream!

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.700
Oh, who's this little girl?

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.040
This is bad. She has absolutely no idea what's going on.

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.700
I'm Yuko's little sister, Ryoko!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.120
Oh, is that so?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.870
I'm Mikan, another Magical Girl
who was called in to help out.

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:26.250
Would you like some ice cream?

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:29.000
Are you another member
of my sister's legion, Ms. Mikan?

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.750
Huh? Legion?

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.200
What is that? The name of some new citrus fruit?

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.120
Mikan... come with me for a second.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:46.080
POKE POKE POKE POKE

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:41.410
Stop, don't touch me with the ice cream there!
My curse will act up!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:46.000
I don't know what's going on,
but I'll be a subordinate! I'll be a subordinate!

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:51.700
Ding...

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.950
As of now I am one of your loyal subordinates...

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.120
Mikan, I'll make it up to you later!

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:56.410
The Magical Girls both enjoyed their ice cream after this.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:55.790
The Magical Girls both enjoyed their ice cream after this.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.660
Hey, look. What do you think that is?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:02.750
The time hath come.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:07.410
Momo... I thought that older sisters
aren't supposed to lie?

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.790
For now, I think we should make sure
she keeps that bright smile of hers.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.620
And if you ask me...

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:16.830
I don't think Ryo's analysis of the situation
is that far from the truth, really.

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:18.200
Huh?

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.540
If you don't understand, then just forget it.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:20.500
Jeez.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:23.870
Are you for real? Can you really accept
being my subordinate?

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.790
That look! You're really finding the idea hard to swallow!

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:32.370
I didn't find any problems with the laptop.

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:35.040
You don't have an A/C at home, right?

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.910
I think it just got overheated.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:42.500
Try to only use it in the coolest room,
and if it gets hot, then let it take a break.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.200
You can come use it here, too.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.660
And now I'm even more indebted to you.

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:48.790
Say, Shamiko.

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:49.500
Huh?

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.580
If you feel that way, then make some more food for me
next time you come.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:56.200
One of the duties of a lord is making sure
their subordinates are well fed and healthy.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:57.580
Okay, Shadow Mistress?

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.250
Damn you! It's not fair
if you say it when nobody's around!

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:04.750
I'm so glad that the laptop wasn't broken.

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:06.700
I'll use it more carefully from now on.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:10.790
It has my journal, my private diary
and a lot of other important data!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:13.700
Wow, you sure are using the laptop
to do a lot of different things.

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:16.160
Yeah. I had Ms. Momo print them all out for me, too.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:18.080
That's way more than any ordinary diary or journal.

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:20.160
Ta-dah!

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.040
Ta-dah!!

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.620
She also taught me how important it is
to keep a variety of backups!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:24.790
I don't really get it, but I feel like
I'm just piling up the debt at this point!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:30.410
I'll study really hard and someday
become an advisor to your army!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.660
...I have to
do something
about this fantasy
of hers

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.620
I have to do everything that I can...

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:40.540
...to someday make Ryo's fantasies come true
and find a way to surpass Momo.

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.580
But how exactly can I do that?

