00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:15.370
Actually, I think she's keeping
a lot of secrets on purpose.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.410
Simply elegant!

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:22.160
Hey Ryo.
I was really lonely today
because you guys
left me behind.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:22.120
Hey Ryo. I was really lonely today
because you guys left me behind.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:24.950
As my future advisor there's something
I'd like to ask you, Ryo.

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:29.750
If you had to seek out information about your enemy
and their weaknesses, what would you do?

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:30.620
Um...

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:34.080
Find a way to get into their good graces
without being suspicious,

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:37.200
and then convince them to open up
and share with me... I guess.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:40.700
If you do it that way,
then they'll naturally start to share their secrets.

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:46.250
My beloved sister
is far more technical
