than I would have ever thought...!!

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:45.750
My beloved sister is far more technical and much more
advanced than I would have ever thought!

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:49.660
But I should take her advice to heart and do my best.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.790
Huh? What is this picture?

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.290
I wonder if Ms. Momo put it in here?

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:59.250
Dear Ryo, This is a picture
of Shamiko's combat attire.
Please enjoy this immortalization
