00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.750
Dear Ryo, This is a picture of Shamiko's combat attire.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.200
Please enjoy this immortalization
of her strength and bravery.

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:04.330
So this is what you look like in battle, Sis.
Can I take a few pictures of you some time?

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:12.160
Curse you, Magical Girl! THIS MEANS WAR!

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:13.700
I think it looks really cool, Sis!

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:18.250
Don't give up, Shamiko! Become a Demon
who exemplifies a cool lifestyle for your little sister!

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:33.450
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:40.700
Gallantly, I demand a duel

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:42.250
I go at it, but I lose

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:43.450
It's beyond disappointing

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:45.000
Shift away from that grief

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:46.410
Even when I’m feeling curt

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:48.080
I’ll express myself with that tail

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:51.870
There's a party in the neighborhood

00:22:51.950 --> 00:22:53.450
Even the dogs are going bow-wow

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:54.750
Each and every last one

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:56.200
For all four seasons

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:59.500
When you fail just laugh it off

00:22:59.660 --> 00:23:06.000
Connecting our hearts like that time once before

00:23:06.410 --> 00:23:11.830
With the miracle that we met in this town

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.580
Grant this wish

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.370
Shoulder those tires and go full throttle

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:24.160
Warning, there's still crises to manage, so enjoy

00:23:24.160 --> 00:23:29.700
Various blooming colors are spilling off the canvas

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:32.580
Now its sunset, don't bother thinking too much

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:34.830
Just go on!

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:39.580
Come on, our compiled dreams can be any color

00:23:39.700 --> 00:23:41.370
So let's play some more

00:23:50.450 --> 00:24:05.500
Preview

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:54.080
Ancestor, there's still so much about Momo,
