00:23:54.250 --> 00:23:56.540
Please watch, I'm really going
to go all out from now on!

00:23:56.540 --> 00:23:57.790
Good! That's the spirit, Shamiko!

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:01.370
Your magic has been slowly growing as of late,
so use it to give Momo a real surprise!

00:24:01.370 --> 00:24:02.290
And make it rhythmical!

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:05.500
Diving into Dreams Once Again!! Break Through the Pink Defense Line

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:03.120
The time hath come!

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:04.080
It seems the time has come

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:05.450
to fully explain everything to Yuko.
